  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ITU Digital Transformation 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to enhance the capacity of citizens, in particular women, youth, school children and persons with disabilities, in developing countries to fully benefit from the digital economy and society, and increase the employment opportunities of young people by strengthening their digital skills through training delivery Digital Transformation Centres (DTC&apos;s). Per 2023 there are DTCs in the following countries: Dominican Republic, Democratic Republic of Congo, Ethiopia, Ghana, Indonesia, Ivory Coast, Morocco, Pakistan, Papua New Guinea, Philippines, Rwanda, Uganda and Zambia.</narrative>
  </description>
